// Deal or Force - Land nobody owns on 1 January 2024.
//
// "owner": "none" makes a region belong to nobody: its provinces stay unowned whatever the
// map painted there, it is drawn in the grey of land no flag flies over, and any country
// that can reach it - over a border of its own or, when it is coastal, by sea from a coast
// of its own - may settle it (ColonisationCore). "none" is the only owner this file takes;
// who owns a province is otherwise history/provinces/ownership.csv.
//
// Antarctica is held by no state under the 1959 Antarctic Treaty, and nobody lives there
// for good - the people on it are research staff who are counted at home - so it opens
// empty. A colonial-era scenario would list its unclaimed regions here the same way.
//
// Files in this folder are read in name order and later ones win, so this one comes after
// 20_population.json and its zero replaces the generated figure.
{
  "aq_x01": { "owner": "none", "population": 0 },
  "aq_x02": { "owner": "none", "population": 0 }
}
